    "description": {
      "value": "These prosthetic feet and legs, created by dwarven alchemists and spellcasters together, are engraved with simple but effective evocation symbols on the ball and heel, empowering you to leap to great heights and blast foes with your feet.\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n- **Frequency:** once per minute\n\nYou blast off from the ground, using the force to leap through the air. The blast feet cast jump on you.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou blast from your feet, dealing 4d6 force damage to all creatures in a 15-foot cone, with a basic Reflex save.\n\nYou can use the first activation once per minute, and the second activation unleashes a 30-foot cone that deals 8d6 damage."
    },
